{"type":"standard","title":"Lipogram","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Lipogram</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q836165","titles":{"canonical":"Lipogram","normalized":"Lipogram","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Lipogram</span></span>"},"pageid":53629,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/Plaque_perec.JPG/330px-Plaque_perec.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":248},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d0/Plaque_perec.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":2272,"height":1704},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1374159554","tid":"ecbc4074-acd4-11f1-8452-36c8d2bf2455","timestamp":"2026-09-10T05:03:13Z","description":"Writing that avoids specific letters","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lipogram","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lipogram?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lipogram?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Lipogram"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lipogram","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Lipogram","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lipogram?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Lipogram"}},"extract":"A lipogram is a kind of constrained writing or word game consisting of writing paragraphs or longer works in which a particular letter or group of letters is avoided. Extended Ancient Greek texts avoiding the letter sigma are the earliest examples of lipograms.","extract_html":"<p>A <b>lipogram</b> is a kind of constrained writing or word game consisting of writing paragraphs or longer works in which a particular letter or group of letters is avoided. Extended Ancient Greek texts avoiding the letter sigma are the earliest examples of lipograms.</p>"}